<title>USA: Nocopi Technologies names new chairman.</title>
<headline>Nocopi Technologies names new chairman.</headline>
<dateline>WAYNE, Pa. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nocopi Technologies Inc said Tuesday it has named Edward Patrone chairman.</p>
<p>Patrone succeeds Ray Mundt, who remains a member of the company's board.</p>
<p>Most recently, Patrone was president of Paper Corporation of America, a unit of Alco Standard Corp. He retired from that post in 1991.</p>
